Value available_system_uptime (.+)
Value switchovers_system_experienced (\d+)
Value standby_failures (\d+)
Value last_switchover_reason (.+)
Value hardware_mode (.+)
Value configured_redundancy_mode (.+)
Value operating_redundancy_mode (.+)
Value maintenance_mode (.+)
Value communications (\S+)
Value communications_reason (.+)
Value active_location (.+)
Value current_software_state (\S+)
Value uptime_in_current_state (.+)
Value image_version (.+)
Value configuration_register (\S+)

Start
  ^Redundant\s+System\s+Information\s*: -> Start
  ^\s*Available\s+system\s+uptime\s+=\s+${available_system_uptime}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^Switchovers\s+system\s+experienced\s+=\s+${switchovers_system_experienced}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Standby\s+failures\s+=\s+${standby_failures}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Last\s+switchover\s+reason\s+=\s+${last_switchover_reason}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Hardware\s+Mode\s+=\s+${hardware_mode}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Configured\s+Redundancy\s+Mode\s+=\s+${configured_redundancy_mode}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Operating\s+Redundancy\s+Mode\s+=\s+${operating_redundancy_mode}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Maintenance\s+Mode\s+=\s+${maintenance_mode}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Communications\s+=\s+${communications}\s+Reason:\s+${communications_reason}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^Current\s+Processor\s+Information\s*: -> Start
  ^\s*Active\s+Location\s+=\s+${active_location}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Current\s+Software\s+state\s+=\s+${current_software_state}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Uptime\s+in\s+current\s+state\s+=\s+${uptime_in_current_state}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Image\s+Version\s+=\s+${image_version}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*Configuration\s+register\s+=\s+${configuration_register}\s*$$ -> Record
